gfs is an idle HTTP companion that creates a Kubernetes Job running
the groot collector (collect → optional object-storage upload). It ships a
minimal vanilla HTML page (API key + "Generate GROOT files") and a JSON API.

The package installs the static binary, man page, license, and README.
Configure via environment (see docs/SPECIFICATIONS.md upstream). Not a
replacement for the groot CLI.

WWW: https://github.com/hrodrig/groot-share
